/-- **Lemma IV for SU(2) straight blocking on `(ℤ/2Mℤ)⁴`** (every `M ≥ 1`, every real `β`):
`E_μ[u | σ(c)] = Π u` on `H`, `c(U)(y, μ) = U(2y, μ) U(2y + e_μ, μ)`. -/
